OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue outbreak 'really
OL,4,Adistressing for farmers'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been extremely emotionally and
OL,7,Ffinancially difficult for a lot of
OL,8,Ffarmers," said Tom Clark.
OL,10,FThe Dorset-based vet is becoming
OL,11,Fincreasingly worried about an ongoing
OL,12,Foutbreak of bluetongue in the county.
OL,14,FFifty cases have already been confirmed
OL,15,Fin Dorset, with Oxfordshire and Isle of
OL,16,FWight also joining the government list
OL,17,Fof affected areas in recent days.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
