OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue outbreak 'really
OL,4,Adistressing for farmers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Gelfs, who has farmed in Dorset for
OL,7,Fthe past 20 years, told the BBC that
OL,8,Fhis "biggest" concern was the long-term
OL,9,Fimpact of the outbreak on the fertility
OL,10,Fof livestock.
